# emz

--- Mummy_Acid | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_MUMMY_ACID_DESC
raw  Emz squirts out hairspray that goes through walls! Deals <!card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel> damage.
now  Emz squirts out hairspray that goes through walls! Deals 1120 damage.
  card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel  1120  -> 1120

--- Mummy_Acid | gadget | TID_MUMMY_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DESC
