--- Mummy_Push | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_MUMMY_PUSH_DESC
raw  Emz fires off some hairspray that pushes enemies back. Deals <!card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel> damage.
now  Emz fires off some hairspray that pushes enemies back. Deals 500 damage.
  card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel  500  -> 500

--- Mummy_Push | gadget | TID_MUMMY_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Emz fires off some hairspray that strongly pushes enemies back. Deals <!card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel> damage. Stuns the enemy for <!buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.customUniquePropertyValue.ticksAsSeconds> seconds if knocked into a wall.
now  Emz fires off some hairspray that strongly pushes enemies back. Deals 500 damage. Stuns the enemy for 1 seconds if knocked into a wall.
  card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel  500  -> 500
  buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.customUniquePropertyValue.ticksAsSeconds  1  -> 1

--- Mummy_Push | gadget | TID_MUMMY_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DIFF
raw  Knocks enemies back farther and stuns them for <!buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.customUniquePropertyValue.ticksAsSeconds> sec if knocked into a wall.
now  Knocks enemies back farther and stuns them for 1 sec if knocked into a wall.
  buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.customUniquePropertyValue.ticksAsSeconds  1  -> 1

--- Mummy_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_TICK_DMG_GROW_DESC
raw  Enemies that stay within the cloud of Emz's toxic hair spray suffer increasing damage, <VALUE1>% per hit.
now  Enemies that stay within the cloud of Emz's toxic hair spray suffer increasing damage, 25% per hit.
  VALUE1  25  -> 25

--- Mummy_unique | star power | TID_MUMMY_BUDDY_STARPOWER_1_DESC
raw  Enemies that stay within the cloud of Emz's toxic hair spray suffer increasing damage, <!card.value1>% per hit. Reduce damage dealt by enemies hit by Emz's main attack by <!buddy.trait.statusEffect.damageReducePercent>% for <!buddy.trait.statusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds> sec.
now  Enemies that stay within the cloud of Emz's toxic hair spray suffer increasing damage, 25% per hit. Reduce damage dealt by enemies hit by Emz's main attack by 15% for 4 sec.
  card.value1  25  -> 25
  buddy.trait.statusEffect.damageReducePercent  15  -> 15
  buddy.trait.statusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds  4  -> 4

--- Mummy_unique | star power | TID_MUMMY_BUDDY_STARPOWER_1_DIFF
raw  Reduce damage dealt by enemies hit by Emz's main attack by <!buddy.trait.statusEffect.damageReducePercent>% for <!buddy.trait.statusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds> sec.
now  Reduce damage dealt by enemies hit by Emz's main attack by 15% for 4 sec.
  buddy.trait.statusEffect.damageReducePercent  15  -> 15
  buddy.trait.statusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds  4  -> 4

--- Mummy_unique_2 | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_HEAL_SUPER_DMG_DESC
raw  Emz recovers <VALUE1> health per second for each enemy Brawler inside her Super's area of effect.
now  Emz recovers 8 health per second for each enemy Brawler inside her Super's area of effect.
